1. POST /api/workspace/sessions
      → sessionId, guestLinkUrl (if allowGuestLink), status=Pending

2. GET  /api/workspace/sessions/{id}/bootstrap   (optional if editor already has content)
      → scenes[].contentUrl, assets[].contentUrl, colyseusEndpoint

3. GET  scenes/assets contentUrls (only if you need to load/download)
      → /api/workspace/session-scenes/content?...
      → /api/workspace/session-assets/content?...

4. POST /api/workspace/sessions/{id}/join-ticket
      → joinTicket JWT

5. Colyseus joinOrCreate('collab', { sessionId, joinTicket, wantsSceneSync })
      → room-started webhook → status=Active

6. (later) POST /api/workspace/sessions/{id}/end   // host only
      → status=Ended


Shared user (join)
1. GET  /api/workspace/sessions
   or GET /api/workspace/sessions/{id}
      → find session shared with you

2. GET  /api/workspace/sessions/{id}/bootstrap
      → contentUrls + colyseusEndpoint

3. GET  session-scenes / session-assets contentUrls
      → download scene JSON / asset ZIPs as needed

4. POST /api/workspace/sessions/{id}/join-ticket
      → joinTicket JWT

5. Colyseus joinOrCreate('collab', { sessionId, joinTicket, wantsSceneSync })

Guest
1. Open guestLinkUrl  (from create response / host share)
      → contains guestToken

2. POST /api/public/sessions/join
      { guestToken, displayName }
      → joinTicket + sessionId

3. GET  /api/public/sessions/bootstrap?guestToken=...
      → contentUrls (public)

4. GET  public contentUrls
      → /api/public/session-scenes/content?guestToken=&sceneId=
      → /api/public/session-assets/content?guestToken=&sceneId=&assetId=

5. Colyseus joinOrCreate('collab', { sessionId, joinTicket, wantsSceneSync })



